WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:04.270
(DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYING
INTERMITTENTLY)

00:00:08.173 --> 00:00:09.742
NARRATOR:<i> In 2017,</i>

00:00:10.276 --> 00:00:12.978
<i>HBO's biggest Sunday night show</i>

00:00:13.212 --> 00:00:14.413
<i> returns.</i>

00:00:14.747 --> 00:00:15.849
(MUSIC STOPS)

00:00:15.982 --> 00:00:17.317
Oh, wait.

00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:19.185
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:00:19.552 --> 00:00:20.754
-You meant...
-NARRATOR:<i> Yeah, not you.</i>

00:00:21.087 --> 00:00:22.889
Right. It's just,
I heard your voice

00:00:22.889 --> 00:00:25.291
-and I assumed--
-NARRATOR:<i> I said biggest.</i>

00:00:25.691 --> 00:00:26.425
You did.

00:00:26.959 --> 00:00:28.928
NARRATOR:<i> But 2017
 also brings you</i>

00:00:28.928 --> 00:00:33.432
<i>the much awaited fourth season
of HBO's smash hit comedy...</i>

00:00:33.766 --> 00:00:35.034
(MUSIC STOPS)

00:00:35.534 --> 00:00:38.404
Oh, again. I thought you were
talking about a different show.

00:00:38.404 --> 00:00:40.506
-He said "hit comedy."
-I hear that now.

00:00:40.506 --> 00:00:41.875
At best you are
an acquired taste.

00:00:42.008 --> 00:00:43.809
-You have made your point.
-Sometimes we don't want

00:00:43.909 --> 00:00:46.346
a British man yelling at us
about how the world is ending

00:00:46.346 --> 00:00:47.413
for a whole hour.

00:00:47.413 --> 00:00:48.814
Well, it's a half-an-hour show.

00:00:48.814 --> 00:00:50.116
Doesn't feel like it.

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:51.985
(DRAMATIC MUSIC RESUMES)

00:00:52.152 --> 00:00:54.954
NARRATOR:<i> And finally,
it's the long awaited return</i>

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:58.491
<i>of the HBO show everyone's
 been waiting for.</i>

00:00:58.625 --> 00:00:59.558
(MUSIC STOPS)

00:00:59.725 --> 00:01:00.360
Oh, no.

00:01:00.794 --> 00:01:02.128
Oh, you thought that
applied to you?

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:04.330
Yeah, I did. Because we've been
off for awhile. So...

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:05.664
Well, you know, five years.

00:01:05.664 --> 00:01:07.700
Yeah, why have you been off
for five years?

00:01:07.834 --> 00:01:09.368
LARRY DAVID:
I've been busy, okay?

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:10.804
What have you been doing?

00:01:12.838 --> 00:01:13.706
Things.

00:01:14.573 --> 00:01:17.143 line:0%
NARRATOR: Last Week Tonight
With John Oliver.

00:01:17.744 --> 00:01:19.546
<i>-Don't even think about it.</i>
-Sorry.

00:01:19.546 --> 00:01:22.281
<i>Returns Sunday, February 12th
 on HBO.</i>

00:01:22.281 --> 00:01:23.483 line:0%
<i> Try it free.</i>

